The bar model is divided into equal parts. What is the ratio of shaded parts to unshaded parts?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.5]
\draw[fill=blue!25] (0,0) rectangle ++(1,1);
\draw[fill=blue!25] (1,0) rectangle ++(1,1);
\draw[fill=blue!25] (2,0) rectangle ++(1,1);
\draw[fill=blue!25] (3,0) rectangle ++(1,1);
\draw[fill=blue!25] (4,0) rectangle ++(1,1);
\draw[fill=white] (5,0) rectangle ++(1,1);
\draw[fill=white] (6,0) rectangle ++(1,1);
\draw[fill=white] (7,0) rectangle ++(1,1);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the ratio of circles to triangles?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]
\draw[fill=green!40] (0.00,0.05) -- ++(0.9,0) -- ++(-0.45,0.82) -- cycle;
\draw[fill=green!40] (1.05,0.05) -- ++(0.9,0) -- ++(-0.45,0.82) -- cycle;
\draw[fill=green!40] (2.10,0.05) -- ++(0.9,0) -- ++(-0.45,0.82) -- cycle;
\draw[fill=green!40] (3.15,0.05) -- ++(0.9,0) -- ++(-0.45,0.82) -- cycle;
\draw[fill=green!40] (4.20,0.05) -- ++(0.9,0) -- ++(-0.45,0.82) -- cycle;
\draw[fill=orange!40] (6.40,0.45) circle (0.42);
\draw[fill=orange!40] (7.45,0.45) circle (0.42);
\draw[fill=orange!40] (8.50,0.45) circle (0.42);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

